    oe:aboutDisease oed:major_depressive_disorder ;
    oe:answerText "Previous treatment studies have suggested an antidepressant effect of adjunctive probiotics, but more high-quality randomized controlled trials (RCTs) are needed before clinical implementation. The mechanisms underlying putative antidepressant effects of probiotics are not understood, but one possibility is that they are mediated via short-chain fatty acids (SCFAs) - neuroactive bacterial metabolites with anti-inflammatory properties."^^xsd:string ;
